@work_with_plfm
title: Strengthen our bonds with the {!<span style="color: #540808;"><strong>PLFM</strong></span>!}
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
subtitle: The local sections of both parties have established a long cooperation that we can exploit.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; plfm_relation += 5

The local {!<span style="color: #540808;"><strong>PLFM</strong></span>!} section has long shared close ties with our own branch. Their ongoing cooperation in Melacus creates a strong foundation of trust, gradually bringing both parties closer together on a planetary scale.

@pushing_leftism
title: Pushing Leftism in the Party
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
