subtitle: The local section seeks to push leftist rhetoric into the party.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent += 3

The Melacus branch works to strengthen the party's leftist wing. Naturally, the reformist wing is displeased.

